# Supabase Migrations

**Never create migration files.** Do not write new `.sql` files in `supabase/migrations/` and do not run migration commands.

When migration SQL is needed, provide the SQL content and instruct the user to create the migration themselves:

```bash
npx supabase migration new [migration name]
```

Then they can paste the SQL into the generated file.
